<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 316 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 316 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural volume totaled 316 contracts versus 899 the prior overnight session.</p>
<p>There were 27 wheat, 135 corn, 142 soybean, three soymeal, five soyoil and four rice contracts traded.</p>
<p>Wheat was steady to 1-3/4 cents lower, corn was 1/2 to 3/4 cent higher and soybeans were 1/2 to one cent higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
